oints that do not belong to $M.$\n\n![](images/e8/e847aa005e917a88b19566933e3770edd05ddee946fc25dfd6fed91016bb909d.png)\n\n- Statement “$B$ is an interior point of the set $M$” is false. The point $B$ is *not* an interior point of $M$ since any neighborhood of $B$ contains at least one point *outside* the set.\n\n![](images/51/51439f6021efd768268e59c63627449cc68c9a420c4c7a80ab6773dd46e6ec1f.png)\n\n- Statement “$C$ is an interior point of the set $M$” is true. The point $C$ is an interior point since there exists an open neighborhood of $C$ that is fully contained inside the set $M.$\n\n![](images/dd/ddd471167f604b4ba97b36ddff3af6be7c7d3cfad6021a4cfc779c6f8ebb2a3d.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is '“$A$ is a boundary point of the set $M$” and “$C$ is an interior point of the set $M$” only.'"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186376110 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124635 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b34c9c06-e884-5758-a184-39330a07d8cd" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Interior and Boundary Points of Sets of Real Numbers"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "06f7134e-0413-5493-b5ac-15d4ba28ba08" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471101} {:answer/id #uuid "835a584d-b0a9-5f05-8080-ffa33c185d64" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471102}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "06f7134e-0413-5493-b5ac-15d4ba28ba08" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186471101} :answer-field/id #uuid "e62b53c0-c439-5e2d-9680-fe8ad1611219" :answer-field/key "$A$ is a boundary point of the set $M$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472056} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fbd59ee7-1ac2-5275-ae13-009